WEBVTT

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.353
Get away from my godson.

00:00:46.447 --> 00:00:49.033
Now, listen to me.
Take the others and get out of here.

00:00:49.408 --> 00:00:51.201
What? No, I'm staying with you.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:54.204
You've done beautifully.

00:00:54.913 --> 00:00:56.498
Now, let me take it from here.

00:00:56.665 --> 00:00:57.708
Black.

00:01:24.735 --> 00:01:26.028
Expelliarmus!

00:01:26.195 --> 00:01:27.529
Nice one, James.

00:01:34.953 --> 00:01:36.455
Avada Kedavra.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:58.977
No. No.

00:02:22.668 --> 00:02:25.212
I killed Sirius Black. Ha-ha-ha!

00:02:26.505 --> 00:02:28.507
-You coming to get me?
-Crucio.

00:02:40.811 --> 00:02:43.981
You've got to mean it, Harry.

00:02:44.148 --> 00:02:47.901
She killed him. She deserves it.

00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:54.340
You know the spell, Harry.

00:03:06.545 --> 00:03:08.130
Do it.

00:03:15.804 --> 00:03:17.435
So weak.

00:03:25.564 --> 00:03:27.984
It was foolish of you
to come here tonight, Tom.

00:03:28.901 --> 00:03:30.652
The Aurors are on their way.

00:03:30.819 --> 00:03:35.073
By which time I shall be gone, and you...

00:03:36.575 --> 00:03:37.800
...shall be dead.

00:05:52.961 --> 00:05:54.838
You've lost, old man.

